title = Citadis 302
description = Citadis is a family of low-floor trams and light rail vehicles built by Alstom. As of 2025, over 8,000 Citadis trams have been ordered, with operations in over 140 cities on all six inhabited continents. Built in 2011 as part of the Citadis X02 series, this 32-meter-long vehicle features a 2.4-meter width and operates on a 1435 mm gauge.
